PTX 2W+tear+weak.gpu
"Two weak 32-bit stores of two 16-bit granules and a relaxed 32-bit load (.gpu): can the load see one store in one granule and the other store in the other?"
{
x[0]=0;
x[1]=0;
P2:r0[0]=0;
P2:r0[1]=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P2@cta 2,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak.b32 x, 1         | st.weak.b32 x, 2         | ld.relaxed.gpu.b32 r0, x ;
exists
(P2:r0[0] == 1 /\ P2:r0[1] == 2)
